### ==============================================================================
### StackStorm E-Commerce Platform — REST Client Test Suite
### Dickwella Fashion Corner (SENG 31242)
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### 1. Root API Discovery & Service Directory
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. System Health, Database, Redis & Memory Probe
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Categories Hierarchy Tree (Redis Cache-Aside)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/categories/tree
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Products Listing with Faceted Filtering & Pagination
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Products Filtered by Sri Lankan Rupee Price Range & Size
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products?min_price=2000&max_price=8000&size=M&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Product Detail by Slug (with Gallery, Reviews & Real-time Stock)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/classic-batik-short-sleeve-shirt
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Customer Registration (STORM-012)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer.test@dickwellafashion.lk",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "first_name": "Kasun",
  "last_name": "Kalhara",
  "phone": "+94771234567"
}

###

### 8. User Login & Token Rotation (STORM-013)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@dickwellafashion.lk",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 9. Update Product & Evict Redis Cache (Admin Only - STORM-022)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE>

{
  "title": "Classic Batik Short Sleeve Shirt (Handmade Edition)"
}

###

### 10. Fetch Updated Product (Re-primes Cache with Fresh Data)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/classic-batik-short-sleeve-shirt
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Add Item to Cart (Guest or Authenticated - STORM-023)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/cart
Content-Type: application/json
X-Session-ID: guest_sample_sess_001

{
  "variant_id": "d0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 12. Get Active Shopping Cart (STORM-023)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/cart
X-Session-ID: guest_sample_sess_001
Accept: application/json

###

### 13. Merge Guest Cart into Customer Account (STORM-023)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/cart/merge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <PASTE_CUSTOMER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE>

{
  "guest_session_id": "guest_sample_sess_001"
}


